{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Teleprompter &amp; Prompter Video 是一款專為影片錄製而設的提詞工具，適合需要面對鏡頭演講、教學、介紹產品或向客戶匯報的創作者、學生、教師、創業者及主講人。這款 App 正提供限時免費優惠，原價 US $0.99，讓你可以更輕鬆地讀稿錄影。</p>\n\n<h2>流暢讀稿錄影體驗</h2>\n<p>這款工具提供簡易的講稿庫管理，讓使用者快速輸入或貼上講稿，並可自由調整捲動速度與文字大小。啟用鏡像模式後，配合提詞機使用更加方便，幫助你在錄製教學影片或客戶簡報時保持自然流暢，無需死記內容。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-146-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-147-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-148-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-149-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-150-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-151-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Teleprompter &amp; Prompter Video</li>\n<li>應用類別：Productivity</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-04T07:40:00.391517+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":305,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}